'''Mudsdale''' (Japanese: '''バンバドロ''' ''Banbadoro'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

